<main id="main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div class="page-hero-text"><span class="eyebrow light"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>IMPORTANT INFORMATION</span><h1>Your information <em>matters.</em></h1><p>A draft privacy notice for this website concept.</p></div><div class="page-hero-image"><img alt="Natural-light office environment" class="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/office-interior.webp"/></div></div></section><section class="page-section"><article class="article-layout"><div class="article-disclaimer"><strong>Draft only.</strong> This is not the final legal privacy policy. It must be reviewed against the firm's actual services, data practices and applicable Australian privacy requirements.</div><h2>What this form collects</h2><p>We request a name, email address, enquiry subject and a short message to help the firm respond to an enquiry. Please do not submit sensitive identity information or confidential financial documents through the public form.</p><h2>How a message is handled</h2><p>Once approved and configured, submitted information will be sent through an email provider to the firm's designated mailbox. The provider, hosting region, retention periods and contact details need to be confirmed before production launch.</p><h2>Newsletter and analytics</h2><p>The demonstration website does not collect subscribers or enable third-party analytics. Newsletter editions and articles are added manually through PHP content files.</p><h2>Updates and privacy requests</h2><p>The final policy requires the firm's actual privacy contact, procedures for accessing or correcting information, complaint-handling details and relevant disclosure practices. The client or their adviser should approve the wording.</p></article></section><section class="cta-section" data-reveal=""><div class="container"><div class="cta-inner"><div class="cta-copy"><span class="eyebrow light"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>LET’S BEGIN</span><h2>Good conversations.<br/><em>Better decisions.</em></h2><p>Tell us what you're working towards. We’ll start with a conversation.</p><a class="button button-cream" href="/contact/"><span>Start a conversation</span><span class="button-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.5 12H19m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="cta-photo"><img alt="Sunlit modern professional office interior" class="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/office-interior.webp"/></div></div></div></section></main>
